    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this origin story of Project C.U.R.E. you will control the actions of Kin, a knight whose memory of his past life has been lost. Travel around the world and discover who Kin truly is and how the world came to be in the state it's in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Combat</strong> - Fight against monsters and tough bosses in turn-based combat where you will control a max of 4 characters in battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/f3d6d60f7c99a8853619fd8402e74ec3.poster.avif?t=1747537526\" width=616 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/f3d6d60f7c99a8853619fd8402e74ec3.webm?t=1747537526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/f3d6d60f7c99a8853619fd8402e74ec3.mp4?t=1747537526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn skills</strong> - Within the Axis each character will be able to learn from three types of skill categories to use in battle: Skills, Essence Skills and Ultimate Skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/5833fce68423acbe544e148ac1d6b5a0.poster.avif?t=1747537526\" width=616 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/5833fce68423acbe544e148ac1d6b5a0.webm?t=1747537526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/5833fce68423acbe544e148ac1d6b5a0.mp4?t=1747537526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> - As you progress through the story, explore new areas with many secrets and treasure to collect.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/ac38f61a0add95edf64a9356dfa84f96.poster.avif?t=1747537526\" width=616 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/ac38f61a0add95edf64a9356dfa84f96.webm?t=1747537526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/ac38f61a0add95edf64a9356dfa84f96.mp4?t=1747537526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeons and Puzzles</strong> - Delve deep into dungeons and solve puzzles that will test your intellect, logic and skills.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/cce99493ca5f8d1d053b7fd3f674b1eb.poster.avif?t=1747537526\" width=616 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/cce99493ca5f8d1d053b7fd3f674b1eb.webm?t=1747537526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/cce99493ca5f8d1d053b7fd3f674b1eb.mp4?t=1747537526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this origin story of Project C.U.R.E. you will control the actions of Kin, a knight whose memory of his past life has been lost. Travel around the world and discover who Kin truly is and how the world came to be in the state it's in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Combat</strong> - Fight against monsters and tough bosses in turn-based combat where you will control a max of 4 characters in battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/f3d6d60f7c99a8853619fd8402e74ec3.poster.avif?t=1747537526\" width=616 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/f3d6d60f7c99a8853619fd8402e74ec3.webm?t=1747537526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/f3d6d60f7c99a8853619fd8402e74ec3.mp4?t=1747537526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn skills</strong> - Within the Axis each character will be able to learn from three types of skill categories to use in battle: Skills, Essence Skills and Ultimate Skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/5833fce68423acbe544e148ac1d6b5a0.poster.avif?t=1747537526\" width=616 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/5833fce68423acbe544e148ac1d6b5a0.webm?t=1747537526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/5833fce68423acbe544e148ac1d6b5a0.mp4?t=1747537526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> - As you progress through the story, explore new areas with many secrets and treasure to collect.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/ac38f61a0add95edf64a9356dfa84f96.poster.avif?t=1747537526\" width=616 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/ac38f61a0add95edf64a9356dfa84f96.webm?t=1747537526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/ac38f61a0add95edf64a9356dfa84f96.mp4?t=1747537526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeons and Puzzles</strong> - Delve deep into dungeons and solve puzzles that will test your intellect, logic and skills.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/cce99493ca5f8d1d053b7fd3f674b1eb.poster.avif?t=1747537526\" width=616 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/cce99493ca5f8d1d053b7fd3f674b1eb.webm?t=1747537526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643690/extras/cce99493ca5f8d1d053b7fd3f674b1eb.mp4?t=1747537526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
